          },
          "EMBEDDED_SOLAR_GENERATION": {
            "description": "This is an estimate of the GB solar generation from PV panels. These are embedded in the distribution network and invisible to National Grid ESO. Their effect is to suppress the electricity demand during periods of high radiation. The true output of these generators is not known so an estimate is pr",
